[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 843.35, "timestamp": "00:14:03", "text": "我發現，看著"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 845.269, "timestamp": "00:14:05", "text": "我的創意朋友和其他創作者，我深受啟發，我也想做一些類似的事情，但要用我自己的方式來呈現"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 849.35, "timestamp": "00:14:09", "text": "。那真是太酷了。  是的，我也應該做點類似的事情，因為很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 853.189, "timestamp": "00:14:13", "text": "人不知道還有"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 855.373, "timestamp": "00:14:15", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "thats why i have stopped midnight snacks too"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 856.31, "timestamp": "00:14:16", "text": "會員制度這種東西。但是，就像……嗯，我的做法是，我們稱之為……因為我們是多平台"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 869.91, "timestamp": "00:14:29", "text": "串流媒體，所以我們是統一的，所有白金平台都是統一的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 894.71, "timestamp": "00:14:54", "text": "如果我沒記錯的話。送禮物的人，還有超級留言，有超級留言嗎？"}]